OL,3,AKenyan president orders crackdown on
OL,4,Aforeigners operating small businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FKenya's President William Ruto has
OL,7,Fordered a crackdown on foreigners
OL,8,Foperating small-scale businesses,
OL,9,Fsaying local traders and hawkers need
OL,10,Fto be protected.
OL,12,FHis announcement comes amid growing
OL,13,Fdebate about the increasing number of
OL,14,FAfrican migrants involved in Kenya's
OL,15,Fvast informal economy.
OL,17,F"From next week, all [foreign] traders
OL,18,Fdoing those small businesses should
OL,19,Fclose them," he said, also promising to
OL,20,Ffast-track proposed legislation to
OL,21,Fpreclude foreigners from certain areas
OL,22,Fof trade.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
