OL,3,AKenyan president orders crackdown on
OL,4,Aforeigners operating small businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FRuto said Kenya remained open to
OL,7,Fforeign investment, but argued that
OL,8,Finvestors - including Chinese traders -
OL,9,Fshould create jobs and expand
OL,10,Fproduction rather than compete with
OL,11,FKenyans in small businesses.
